1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,880
So much has happened.

2
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:22,980
I won't even pretend like I remember every little detail.

3
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:26,980
Because each day was unique in its own way.

4
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:32,620
Though most of the memories have faded or vanished completely,

5
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:35,780
some are still as vivid now as they were then.

6
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:42,540
As if they happened yesterday.

7
00:00:56,980 --> 00:01:14,500
I was the one that I was the one I don't know.

8
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:44,480
Toi

9
00:01:44,500 --> 00:02:14,480
I'll see you next time.

10
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:44,480
I'll see you next time.

11
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:48,580
But we get to do way more on our own now that we're high schoolers, which is great.

12
00:02:49,220 --> 00:02:52,340
Uh-huh. Except at night.

13
00:02:53,220 --> 00:02:56,760
Oh, yeah. Your tattoos. Will you be able to take baths?

14
00:02:56,760 --> 00:03:02,820
I don't think so, no. But I'm fully prepared to go without them for the whole trip.

15
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:06,580
Too bad boys don't have private baths in their rooms like the girls.

16
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:08,880
Gonna change clothes at least?

17
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:10,700
In the bathroom stall.

18
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:13,480
I see. Good luck.

19
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:17,480
Will I enjoy this trip, like, at all?

20
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:20,380
Will he enjoy this trip, like, at all?

21
00:03:20,620 --> 00:03:23,620
There you guys are! Took you long enough, huh?

22
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,160
Sup, shoes?

23
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:25,420
Yeah!

24
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:26,900
Where'd everyone else go?

25
00:03:27,620 --> 00:03:28,500
Um...

26
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:30,060
You're yelling scared in my bed.

27
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,180
Who's what did what?

28
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:32,120
Lookie!

29
00:03:32,380 --> 00:03:34,500
I got souvenirs from the shop up ahead.

30
00:03:35,700 --> 00:03:37,620
Had to strike while the iron was hot.

31
00:03:38,100 --> 00:03:39,400
Souvenirs on day one?

32
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:43,360
Dude, why load up with more junk to carry before you make it to the hotel?

33
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:47,080
Ah, that's a good point. Let's eat them now!

34
00:03:47,420 --> 00:03:48,580
Wanna help me out, Miyamura?

35
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:50,080
Um, I, uh...

36
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:53,200
The kid's nuts to go and buy that stuff right off the bat.

37
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:55,560
Her enthusiasm just evaporated.

38
00:03:56,220 --> 00:03:58,680
Hey, aren't you and Yorta in the same room?

39
00:03:59,380 --> 00:04:01,580
Yeah, me, him, and Ishikawa.

40
00:04:04,140 --> 00:04:05,480
It'll be fun.

41
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,480
Something tells me it won't.

42
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:18,860
This bed is so soft.

43
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:21,860
The whole room's even better than I thought it'd be.

44
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:25,760
But having free time till dinner is pretty worthless.

45
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:27,360
There's nothing to do.

46
00:04:27,900 --> 00:04:28,840
You got that right.

47
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,500
Let's crash another room.

48
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:32,680
Ooh, like a boy's room?

49
00:04:32,760 --> 00:04:33,220
Maybe.

50
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:39,380
If neither of us grab the key...

51
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:41,700
Shu picked it up, then disappeared.

52
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:43,480
What are you two doing?

53
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:43,900
Oh.

54
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:47,260
We're waiting. Shu has our room key.

55
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:48,580
Seen him around, Mizuchi?

56
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:49,340
Sure.

57
00:04:50,380 --> 00:04:52,280
Saw him waltz into that room a minute ago.

58
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:54,960
Open this door right now, you idiot!

59
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:56,420
Let us in!

60
00:04:58,040 --> 00:05:00,760
My bad for napping.

61
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:04,440
Not mad that you napped!

62
00:05:04,500 --> 00:05:06,180
I'm mad you didn't let us in first!

63
00:05:06,900 --> 00:05:08,820
At least our stuff is in the room now.

64
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,760
Why don't we take it easy till dinner?

65
00:05:11,260 --> 00:05:13,320
You know, that's not a bad idea.

66
00:05:13,740 --> 00:05:15,480
What's our time frame looking like anyway?

67
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:16,420
Hang on.

68
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:17,460
I'll check.

69
00:05:18,180 --> 00:05:18,620
Shu?

70
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:19,720
Are you awake?

71
00:05:20,820 --> 00:05:22,320
Maybe I'll take a nap too.

72
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:23,500
Oh!

73
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:26,020
We have to hop in the bath before dinner, right?

74
00:05:27,060 --> 00:05:27,740
Do we?

75
00:05:28,180 --> 00:05:28,880
Oh, crap.

76
00:05:29,220 --> 00:05:30,680
Let's get squeaky clean!

77
00:05:30,980 --> 00:05:31,260
No!

78
00:05:31,500 --> 00:05:32,240
Let's not!

79
00:05:32,460 --> 00:05:33,880
Stop being so shy!

80
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,200
Everyone here is a pro!

81
00:05:35,820 --> 00:05:37,880
I'm gonna take my bath later.

82
00:05:38,500 --> 00:05:38,940
Hey!

83
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:40,360
Move it along, group one.

84
00:05:40,820 --> 00:05:42,020
There's a line.

85
00:05:42,020 --> 00:05:44,840
Please help me, Ishikawa!

86
00:05:46,700 --> 00:05:52,920
I think he's feeling sick.

87
00:05:53,620 --> 00:05:54,620
Oh, you have a fever?

88
00:05:54,840 --> 00:05:55,500
Or a cold?

89
00:05:55,840 --> 00:05:58,620
Or, well, not a cold exactly.

90
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:01,460
He's not normal sick.

91
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,480
He's on his period.

92
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:09,080
Oh, you have those?

93
00:06:12,020 --> 00:06:14,940
Come on, what's the holdup, guys?

94
00:06:15,220 --> 00:06:16,480
Go take your dumb baths.

95
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,200
Dude, shut up!

96
00:06:17,460 --> 00:06:19,800
We're dealing with an existential crisis in here!

97
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:20,380
What?

98
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:23,620
Hey, so, that was a good cover, right?

99
00:06:24,060 --> 00:06:24,760
Good cover.

100
00:06:25,420 --> 00:06:26,240
And goodbye.

101
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,400
Hey, what's going on?

102
00:06:34,660 --> 00:06:37,160
Apparently, I'm on my period right now.

103
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:39,840
This is from the guy who got top marks in Phys Ed?

104
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:42,560
You've got to be kidding!

105
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:45,040
That was your excuse to get out of the public bath?

106
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,160
Oh, my gosh.

107
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:48,680
Wait, so then you aren't taking one at all?

108
00:06:49,220 --> 00:06:49,620
Nope.

109
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:52,040
Cramps are pretty intense, so I'm gonna pass.

110
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:54,720
You know, the shower in our room is free.

111
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:58,160
Yuki went to visit with a friend and won't be back for a while.

112
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:01,200
Uh, but we'd get in trouble.

113
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,940
A guy showering in a girl's room?

114
00:07:03,260 --> 00:07:05,480
Oh, well, only if you want to.

115
00:07:05,700 --> 00:07:06,660
You don't have to.

116
00:07:06,660 --> 00:07:06,720
You don't have to.

117
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:13,220
I feel so alive.

118
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:15,820
You could have taken your time and used the hairdryer.

119
00:07:16,020 --> 00:07:18,800
I don't think either of us could afford for me to take my time.

120
00:07:21,860 --> 00:07:23,420
Do you hear from Yoshikawa?

121
00:07:23,780 --> 00:07:24,320
Not yet.

122
00:07:24,900 --> 00:07:25,300
Cool.

123
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:29,540
I should prep my stuff for tomorrow while I have the chance.

124
00:07:30,540 --> 00:07:31,360
Be honest.

125
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:35,700
Would you just let any guy in your room if they were between a rock and a hard place?

126
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,200
You shouldn't, Tori.

127
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:42,020
Which is why I wouldn't do it.

128
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:42,980
Really?

129
00:07:43,540 --> 00:07:43,900
Really.

130
00:07:45,820 --> 00:07:47,240
You let me inside, though.

131
00:07:47,780 --> 00:07:49,660
Because you're not like that.

132
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:51,200
You'd never, you know?

133
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:53,980
So why even pretend like you are when you aren't?

134
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:54,780
Aren't what?

135
00:07:58,840 --> 00:07:59,840
What am I?

136
00:08:01,700 --> 00:08:03,540
You're a trustworthy kind of guy.

137
00:08:03,780 --> 00:08:05,640
You wouldn't try something.

138
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,140
Sure about that?

139
00:08:08,140 --> 00:08:13,360
I should be getting back to my own hotel room.

140
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:14,960
Thanks again for the shower.

141
00:08:16,180 --> 00:08:16,580
Wait.

142
00:08:17,100 --> 00:08:17,500
Hey!

143
00:08:19,960 --> 00:08:22,740
So if I said he could try something, he would?

144
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:28,820
And why'd he ask about letting other guys in my room anyway?

145
00:08:28,820 --> 00:08:32,320
I took her towel.

146
00:08:33,740 --> 00:08:34,800
Oh, there you are.

147
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:35,160
Yay!

148
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:37,060
You can join the Yukata Club, too!

149
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:38,380
Where have you been all night, dude?

150
00:08:38,920 --> 00:08:41,780
Well, um, just out.

151
00:08:45,880 --> 00:08:46,320
Whoa!

152
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:46,960
Over there!

153
00:08:47,220 --> 00:08:48,320
My go at ten o'clock!

154
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:49,320
It's really good point!

155
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:50,640
Whoa!

156
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,280
Hey there, ladies!

157
00:08:52,580 --> 00:08:53,300
Wait, that them?

158
00:08:55,260 --> 00:08:56,860
I'll give your towel back later.

159
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,200
We have plenty more.

160
00:08:58,820 --> 00:09:01,680
But speaking of, what's your plan for tonight?

161
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:02,700
Huh?

162
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,320
To wash up?

163
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:06,420
I'll handle Yuki if you come over.

164
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,480
Oh, don't worry.

165
00:09:09,180 --> 00:09:09,380
Huh?

166
00:09:10,140 --> 00:09:12,520
There's a late bath for people who miss their time slot.

167
00:09:12,700 --> 00:09:13,340
I can go then.

168
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:14,860
That's convenient?

169
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:18,080
Should have read the itinerary more carefully.

170
00:09:18,580 --> 00:09:19,100
I'm sorry.

171
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,180
Don't be.

172
00:09:24,500 --> 00:09:25,700
Thanks for waiting.

173
00:09:26,160 --> 00:09:27,040
Your turn!

174
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:29,220
Sure about that?

175
00:09:29,900 --> 00:09:33,860
Now I feel plain stupid for thinking so much about how to respond.

176
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:36,200
And why wait till today to read the rules?

177
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:36,920
Hori?

178
00:09:37,700 --> 00:09:39,060
You gonna take a bath or what?

179
00:09:39,780 --> 00:09:40,120
Yup!

180
00:09:40,340 --> 00:09:41,960
And not coming out till 11pm!

181
00:09:42,700 --> 00:09:44,120
You'll be a prune.

182
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:49,800
This class trip flew by so freaking fast!

183
00:09:50,340 --> 00:09:51,100
Sure did.

184
00:09:51,780 --> 00:09:54,500
Parting's such sweet sorrow, but bye for now, Kyoto.

185
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:56,060
We've got pics to remember it!

186
00:09:56,620 --> 00:09:56,900
Ooh!

187
00:09:56,980 --> 00:09:58,080
And I've got space for more!

188
00:09:58,580 --> 00:09:59,580
Gimme a peace sign!

189
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:00,880
Stop it, Yuki!

190
00:10:00,880 --> 00:10:03,520
I'll make you copies when I get these printed, kay?

191
00:10:04,380 --> 00:10:05,100
Thanks, girl.

192
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:07,820
Between yours and our teacher's photos, we'll have a ton!

193
00:10:11,700 --> 00:10:14,400
Look at you, Yura, messing with Toadu!

194
00:10:14,940 --> 00:10:16,420
That was really funny.

195
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,700
Here's East-dubbing your face.

196
00:10:18,700 --> 00:10:26,760
Hope we come back together when we're older.

197
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:27,820
Same.

198
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:31,160
Hey!

199
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:33,200
They want us on the buses, like now!

200
00:10:33,420 --> 00:10:34,420
We're on our way!

201
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:37,480
Over too soon.

202
00:10:37,540 --> 00:10:38,640
Race all y'all to the bus!

203
00:10:38,780 --> 00:10:39,540
Oh, it is on!

204
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:41,160
Miyamura!

205
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:46,600
This was a pretty nice class trip, huh?

206
00:10:51,260 --> 00:10:52,700
Yeah, it was.

207
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:56,100
Get the light out, slowpokes!

208
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:56,860
Coming!

209
00:11:03,860 --> 00:11:04,460
Miyamura?

210
00:11:06,060 --> 00:11:06,880
Oh, wow!

211
00:11:07,300 --> 00:11:08,300
It really is you!

212
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:09,500
Just with shorter hair!

213
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:11,140
Turn off the hose before you can go!

214
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:11,680
I keep talking!

215
00:11:12,300 --> 00:11:12,640
Ugh!

216
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,160
Remy didn't realize!

217
00:11:14,620 --> 00:11:15,040
Sorry!

218
00:11:15,620 --> 00:11:17,200
You're absolutely soaked, huh?

219
00:11:17,900 --> 00:11:18,680
It's fine.

220
00:11:19,060 --> 00:11:20,320
I'll wring myself out later.

221
00:11:20,540 --> 00:11:21,460
That won't do, though!

222
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:22,720
Dry off with the towel!

223
00:11:23,180 --> 00:11:24,140
The nurse has some!

224
00:11:24,780 --> 00:11:25,260
We...

225
00:11:25,260 --> 00:11:26,760
need the nurse for this?

226
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:29,640
Ta-da!

227
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:31,680
Um, thanks a lot.

228
00:11:32,780 --> 00:11:35,440
Can we use these when the nurse isn't even here?

229
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:38,300
You should maybe lose the card again.

230
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:42,960
I'll leave it.

231
00:11:43,580 --> 00:11:44,500
Uh-huh.

232
00:11:45,380 --> 00:11:48,700
Remy's really curious why you always keep your skin covered up.

233
00:11:49,020 --> 00:11:52,120
You didn't even take baths with the other boys during the class trip to Kyoto.

234
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:56,180
Not to mention you opt for running marathons over swimming when it's hot up.

235
00:11:56,460 --> 00:11:57,460
Like, who does that?

236
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,560
I'll tell you who does that!

237
00:11:59,620 --> 00:12:01,400
Your boyfriend, the student council president!

238
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:03,600
Yes, but that doesn't bug me at all.

239
00:12:03,740 --> 00:12:04,460
Why not?

240
00:12:05,140 --> 00:12:09,480
Speaking of Sengoku, he told me that you only change in bathroom stalls in empty classrooms.

241
00:12:10,540 --> 00:12:11,740
So, how come?

242
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:12,660
Dang it.

243
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:14,300
She's more stubborn than I thought.

244
00:12:17,300 --> 00:12:17,700
Ah!

245
00:12:17,700 --> 00:12:19,240
What the heck?

246
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:22,620
I thought you might be a girl, so I checked you for boobs.

247
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:25,980
My face and physique aren't girly enough, though, are they?

248
00:12:26,860 --> 00:12:29,260
Ah, homegirl suspicious.

249
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,000
She'll find me out.

250
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,040
I know it.

251
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:33,340
But I'm tired.

252
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:34,840
And very hot.

253
00:12:35,500 --> 00:12:36,920
And the truth comes out.

254
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:41,000
I was thinking, what if you wore a sweater vest?

255
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:42,640
Arm tats would show.

256
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:43,480
Huh.

257
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:46,300
Yet you'll wear a sailor-style uniform.

258
00:12:47,620 --> 00:12:49,580
I have the chance, but why?

259
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:53,240
I really don't get what's going on in Hori's head.

260
00:12:54,380 --> 00:12:55,340
I'll try it on.

261
00:12:55,660 --> 00:12:57,900
Tell it it was too small, since there's no way it'll fit.

262
00:12:58,380 --> 00:12:59,140
And that'll be that.

263
00:13:03,140 --> 00:13:04,780
Ah, hello, Toru!

264
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:06,040
Come on in.

265
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:07,340
Sorry, I didn't call it Ed.

266
00:13:07,660 --> 00:13:08,800
He's in his room.

267
00:13:09,220 --> 00:13:09,460
Hey!

268
00:13:10,380 --> 00:13:11,960
Need to bump a textbook off you.

269
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:13,720
I forgot mine back at school.

270
00:13:13,940 --> 00:13:15,520
And since you live closer...

271
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:16,960
Wait, what's wrong, dude?

272
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:17,840
Please, stop now!

273
00:13:18,180 --> 00:13:18,840
I'm excited!

274
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:22,240
It's...

275
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:23,840
It's not what you think, Ishikawa.

276
00:13:24,020 --> 00:13:24,340
I swear.

277
00:13:24,800 --> 00:13:25,600
I...

278
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:27,140
Think you're rocking it.

279
00:13:29,940 --> 00:13:31,620
That was not what it looked like!

